          "content": "---\ndate: 2026-08-07\ntags: [auth, testing, bugfix]\ncommit: abc1234\n---\n\n# Fix flaky login test race condition\n\n## What happened\n\n`tests/auth_test.py` had a flaky login test caused by a race condition in\nthe OAuth token refresh flow. Under certain timing, the refresh call could\nbe interleaved with a concurrent request, causing an intermittent failure.\n\n## Fix\n\nWrapped the token refresh call in a retry so it tolerates the race\ncondition instead of failing outright.\n\nLanded in commit `abc1234`.\n\n## Follow-up\n\n- Audit other call sites for the same OAuth token refresh race condition\n  and apply the same retry treatment where needed.\n"
